[1m[38;5;231mWhich approach for the validation module?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mB — rule functions (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mvalidate(values, rules) with composable (value) => message|null rules. Small core, custom rules need no shared-code
[39m     [38;5;246mchanges.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m C — declarative schema
     [38;5;246mvalidate(values, schema) with a data schema and a fixed built-in rule table. Most readable call sites, but new rule
[39m     [38;5;246mkinds mean editing the shared module.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m A — minimal extraction
     [38;5;246mvalidate(values, requiredFields). Presence checks only. Smallest change, but the first non-presence rule forces a [39m
     [38;5;246mredesign.[39m
